{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"同伦论","text":"同伦论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Freudenthal 纬悬定理"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Freudenthal纬悬定理"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>对于带基点 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"空间 $A$, "},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":" $\\Sigma \\dashv \\Omega$ 的单位\n$$\r\nA\\to\\Omega\\Sigma A\r\n$$\n是 $2n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"映射.</p>\n<p>注意我们采用的"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通性"}},{"Plain":"的约定可能与另一些文献不同. 在我们的约定中, 映射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ $n$-连通等价于其每个"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维"}},{"Plain":"都 $n$-连通.</p>\n<p>这是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Blakers–Massey定理","text":"Blakers–Massey 定理"}},{"Plain":"的特例.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}